{"id":"1d779f4a08a1f22e","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetic Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-hierarchy — Arithmetic Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"732c8884db2d0c67\" href=\"?note=732c8884db2d0c67\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md\">../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span>（包含算术语言符号的签名）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\in V\\)</span>（签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 上的公式集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\in V\\)</span>（固定变元集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>（有界量词公式类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"732c8884db2d0c67\" href=\"?note=732c8884db2d0c67\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md\">../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma),\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma),\\Delta_n^0(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma),\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma),\\Delta_n^0(\\Sigma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\">\\(\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec v\\,\\psi\">\\(\\exists\\vec v\\,\\psi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec v\\,\\psi\">\\(\\forall\\vec v\\,\\psi\\)</span> 分别表示按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v(0),\\ldots,\\vec v(k-1)\">\\(\\vec v(0),\\ldots,\\vec v(k-1)\\)</span> 依次添加量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时均约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\Sigma_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\quad\\land\\quad \\Pi_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}zero}\\vdash \\Sigma_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\quad\\land\\quad \\Pi_0^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\Delta_0^0(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\varphi=\\exists\\vec v\\,\\psi)\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\n\\Sigma_{n+1}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\varphi=\\exists\\vec v\\,\\psi)\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\n\\Pi_{n+1}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\varphi=\\forall\\vec v\\,\\psi)\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}pi\\text{-}successor}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\n\\Pi_{n+1}^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma):\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\varphi=\\forall\\vec v\\,\\psi)\n\\right\\}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}delta}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\Delta_n^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma)\\cap\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma)\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}delta}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\Delta_n^0(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\Sigma_n^0(\\Sigma)\\cap\\Pi_n^0(\\Sigma)\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里分层的对象是公式，而不是自然数元组的子集；公式定义出的关系或集合继承相应的算术复杂度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\">\\(\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^0\">\\(\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\)</span> 分别由存在量词块和全称量词块加在对偶层公式之前得到。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Delta_n^0\\)</span> 是同时具有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^0\">\\(\\Pi_n^0\\)</span> 表示的公式类；若按逻辑等价闭包定义各层，则通常将“属于”理解为存在该层中的等价公式。</li>\n<li>公式域现在统一使用上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；量词块由有限变元序列编码，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时出现不存在的末项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{k-1}\">\\(v_{k-1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"732c8884db2d0c67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-delta-0-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"targe